{"id":"cf200cb0e17a27da","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-fibration.md","title":"Fibration","display":"df-fibration — Fibration","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-fibration","aliases":["58-df-fibration","Fibration"],"display":"df-fibration — Fibration","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-cw-complex.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-fibration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-fibration</span><span>Fibration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fibration — Fibration"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9c7e703f871c9421\" href=\"?note=9c7e703f871c9421\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cw-complex.md\">../batch13/58-df-cw-complex.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(E,\\tau_E)\">\\((E,\\tau_E)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(B,\\tau_B)\">\\((B,\\tau_B)\\)</span> (topological spaces), and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:E\\to B\">\\(p:E\\to B\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(I,\\tau_I)=([0,1],\\tau_{[0,1]})\">\\((I,\\tau_I)=([0,1],\\tau_{[0,1]})\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{X\\times I}\">\\(\\tau_{X\\times I}\\)</span> (the product topology of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_X\">\\(\\tau_X\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_I\">\\(\\tau_I\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H:X\\times I\\to B\">\\(H:X\\times I\\to B\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widetilde H_0:X\\to E\">\\(\\widetilde H_0:X\\to E\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S,\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S,\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\)</span> (topological predicates from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CWComplex}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CWComplex}_S\\)</span> (CW-complex predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9c7e703f871c9421\" href=\"?note=9c7e703f871c9421\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cw-complex.md\">../batch13/58-df-cw-complex.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fibration}_S,\\mathrm{SerreFibration}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Fibration}_S,\\mathrm{SerreFibration}_S\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fibration} \\vdash \\mathrm{Fibration}_S(p,E,\\tau_E,B,\\tau_B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Continuous}_S(p,E,\\tau_E,B,\\tau_B)\\land\\forall X,\\tau_X\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\to\\forall H\\;\\forall\\widetilde H_0\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(H,X\\times I,\\tau_{X\\times I},B,\\tau_B)\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\widetilde H_0,X,\\tau_X,E,\\tau_E)\\land p\\circ\\widetilde H_0=H(\\cdot,0)\\to\\exists\\widetilde H\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\widetilde H,X\\times I,\\tau_{X\\times I},E,\\tau_E)\\land p\\circ\\widetilde H=H\\land\\widetilde H(\\cdot,0)=\\widetilde H_0\\bigr)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fibration} \\vdash \\mathrm{Fibration}_S(p,E,\\tau_E,B,\\tau_B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Continuous}_S(p,E,\\tau_E,B,\\tau_B)\\land\\forall X,\\tau_X\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\to\\forall H\\;\\forall\\widetilde H_0\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(H,X\\times I,\\tau_{X\\times I},B,\\tau_B)\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\widetilde H_0,X,\\tau_X,E,\\tau_E)\\land p\\circ\\widetilde H_0=H(\\cdot,0)\\to\\exists\\widetilde H\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\widetilde H,X\\times I,\\tau_{X\\times I},E,\\tau_E)\\land p\\circ\\widetilde H=H\\land\\widetilde H(\\cdot,0)=\\widetilde H_0\\bigr)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fibration} \\vdash \\mathrm{SerreFibration}_S(p,E,\\tau_E,B,\\tau_B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Continuous}_S(p,E,\\tau_E,B,\\tau_B)\\land\\forall X,\\tau_X,\\vec X,\\vec\\Phi\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{CWComplex}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\vec X,\\vec\\Phi)\\to\\forall H\\;\\forall\\widetilde H_0\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(H,X\\times I,\\tau_{X\\times I},B,\\tau_B)\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\widetilde H_0,X,\\tau_X,E,\\tau_E)\\land p\\circ\\widetilde H_0=H(\\cdot,0)\\to\\exists\\widetilde H\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\widetilde H,X\\times I,\\tau_{X\\times I},E,\\tau_E)\\land p\\circ\\widetilde H=H\\land\\widetilde H(\\cdot,0)=\\widetilde H_0\\bigr)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fibration} \\vdash \\mathrm{SerreFibration}_S(p,E,\\tau_E,B,\\tau_B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Continuous}_S(p,E,\\tau_E,B,\\tau_B)\\land\\forall X,\\tau_X,\\vec X,\\vec\\Phi\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{CWComplex}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\vec X,\\vec\\Phi)\\to\\forall H\\;\\forall\\widetilde H_0\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(H,X\\times I,\\tau_{X\\times I},B,\\tau_B)\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\widetilde H_0,X,\\tau_X,E,\\tau_E)\\land p\\circ\\widetilde H_0=H(\\cdot,0)\\to\\exists\\widetilde H\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\widetilde H,X\\times I,\\tau_{X\\times I},E,\\tau_E)\\land p\\circ\\widetilde H=H\\land\\widetilde H(\\cdot,0)=\\widetilde H_0\\bigr)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The incorrect homotopy-group isomorphism clause has been removed: a fibration gives a long exact sequence, not generally an isomorphism <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_n(E)\\cong\\pi_n(B)\">\\(\\pi_n(E)\\cong\\pi_n(B)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The lifting property is expanded here to avoid the former circular dependency with <code>58-df-homotopy-lifting</code>.</li>\n<li>The topology parameters and the five-place continuity predicate are explicit; the former unary/ternary calls did not match their upstream definitions.</li>\n<li>Serre fibrations have the lifting property for CW complexes; Hurewicz fibrations have it for all spaces.</li>\n<li>Examples: covering spaces, Hopf fibrations <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^1 \\to S^3 \\to S^2\">\\(S^1 \\to S^3 \\to S^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hatcher, Algebraic Topology</li>\n<li>Whitehead, Elements of Homotopy Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cw-complex.md","status":"resolved","id":"9c7e703f871c9421","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-cw-complex.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cw-complex.md","status":"resolved","id":"9c7e703f871c9421","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CWComplex}_S$ (CW-complex predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-cw-complex.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(E,\\tau_E)","display":false},{"tex":"(B,\\tau_B)","display":false},{"tex":"p:E\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"(I,\\tau_I)=([0,1],\\tau_{[0,1]})","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{X\\times I}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_I","display":false},{"tex":"H:X\\times I\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"\\widetilde H_0:X\\to E","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S,\\mathrm{Continuous}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CWComplex}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fibration}_S,\\mathrm{SerreFibration}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fibration} \\vdash \\mathrm{Fibration}_S(p,E,\\tau_E,B,\\tau_B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Continuous}_S(p,E,\\tau_E,B,\\tau_B)\\land\\forall X,\\tau_X\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\to\\forall H\\;\\forall\\widetilde H_0\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(H,X\\times I,\\tau_{X\\times I},B,\\tau_B)\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\widetilde H_0,X,\\tau_X,E,\\tau_E)\\land p\\circ\\widetilde H_0=H(\\cdot,0)\\to\\exists\\widetilde H\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\widetilde H,X\\times I,\\tau_{X\\times I},E,\\tau_E)\\land p\\circ\\widetilde H=H\\land\\widetilde H(\\cdot,0)=\\widetilde H_0\\bigr)\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fibration} \\vdash \\mathrm{SerreFibration}_S(p,E,\\tau_E,B,\\tau_B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Continuous}_S(p,E,\\tau_E,B,\\tau_B)\\land\\forall X,\\tau_X,\\vec X,\\vec\\Phi\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{CWComplex}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\vec X,\\vec\\Phi)\\to\\forall H\\;\\forall\\widetilde H_0\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(H,X\\times I,\\tau_{X\\times I},B,\\tau_B)\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\widetilde H_0,X,\\tau_X,E,\\tau_E)\\land p\\circ\\widetilde H_0=H(\\cdot,0)\\to\\exists\\widetilde H\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\widetilde H,X\\times I,\\tau_{X\\times I},E,\\tau_E)\\land p\\circ\\widetilde H=H\\land\\widetilde H(\\cdot,0)=\\widetilde H_0\\bigr)\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\pi_n(E)\\cong\\pi_n(B)","display":false},{"tex":"S^1 \\to S^3 \\to S^2","display":false}],"bytes":2791,"backlinks":[{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-326","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-fibration]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-517","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-fibration.md|58-df-fibration]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["815e63e5071e7b58","3cd1834de4f2efb2","9c7e703f871c9421"]}